Dialogue: 99,0:00:01.46,0:00:05.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cândva, demult, zeii și demonii \Nerau unul și același lucru.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:06.17,0:00:09.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They were sealed away in the\Nabyss of distant memory.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:09.97,0:00:14.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The hearts of humans who feared\Nthe Dark brought this about.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:14.97,0:00:18.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pentru început, \Nhaideți să le numim entități.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:18.31,0:00:23.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now they have awakened from their\Nslumber, and gathered in the Dark.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:23.61,0:00:27.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On the final night of that gathering,\Nwhen Shinma and Humans met again,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:28.78,0:00:31.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a young girl strayed into their midst.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:32.33,0:00:34.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Asta e povestea ei. \NNumele ei este...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:53.41,0:00:53.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E în regulă mâine?
Dialogue: 99,0:00:54.21,0:00:54.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:54.72,0:00:58.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, then, the Shijo Station ticket counter\Nat one o'clock. Să nu întârzii.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:58.56,0:01:00.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Negreșit!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:02.35,0:01:06.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Scuze. Nu-ți face griji. \NVoi fi acolo. Promit!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:06.32,0:01:06.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doamne...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:09.82,0:01:12.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryoko, ești sigură că nu vrei \Nsă te conduc până acasă?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:12.28,0:01:14.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu. Stau foarte aproape de aici.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:15.12,0:01:16.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bine. Ai grijă.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:16.49,0:01:18.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Voi avea. Ne vedem mâine!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:55.32,0:01:59.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me for a moment.\NPlease take your time.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:00.08,0:02:01.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vă mulțumesc.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:22.27,0:02:27.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ea e a cincea victimă, nu-i așa? Nu mai \Nare nici măcar un strop de sânge în corp.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:27.44,0:02:30.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cum e posibil așa ceva?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:30.52,0:02:33.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just like a vampire...\NCould that be what it is?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:33.40,0:02:37.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cut that out. The coroner's\Nlooking into it right now.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:37.45,0:02:39.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't say stupid things like that again.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:44.16,0:02:47.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Scary...\N- How scary.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:19.37,0:03:20.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vai, e așa de cald.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:35.97,0:03:36.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Doamne...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:45.35,0:03:51.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A rash of vampiric attacks had set the\Nold capital of Kyoto abuzz with rumor.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:51.36,0:03:56.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was visiting there on a consultation.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:56.86,0:03:59.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The request came from the\Nparents of a princess
Dialogue: 99,0:03:59.99,0:04:02.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,who had pricked her finger\Non the thorn of a rose.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:08.75,0:04:13.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spiritualist... un cuvânt ce descrie o meserie ce acoperă diferite de activități.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:15.05,0:04:19.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But those with truly strong\Nspiritual powers
Dialogue: 99,0:04:19.26,0:04:21.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,have a hard time making\Na living using them.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:32.23,0:04:34.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Usturoi.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:31.58,0:05:37.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spuneți că doarme de 60 de zile.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:38.87,0:05:39.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A văzut-o vreun doctor?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:41.09,0:05:45.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The doctors gave up on her in the\Nfirst week. Said she was hopeless.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:46.10,0:05:49.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We also had an eminent high\Npriest take a look at her.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:49.68,0:05:54.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... at that time...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:54.81,0:05:57.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,..all he told us was that something\Nhad possessed her.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:57.86,0:05:59.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:03.32,0:06:04.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Possession.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:05.49,0:06:09.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This phenomenon, which can usually be\Nexplained as some form of psychosis,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:09.58,0:06:14.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is still an object of terror, smoldering\Nin the depths of the Japanese soul.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:14.87,0:06:19.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But in fact, one rarely if ever comes\Nacross a true case of possession.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:21.84,0:06:22.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A fox spirit?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:23.38,0:06:29.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems she truly is possessed.\NAllow me to deal with this in my own way.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:38.06,0:06:39.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This'll be informal, but..
Dialogue: 99,0:06:59.92,0:07:01.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:03.38,0:07:05.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll for ego my fee, naturally.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:06.47,0:07:11.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um... There are rumors going around\Nabout a vampire appearing in town...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:11.51,0:07:12.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop talking such nonsense!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:12.89,0:07:16.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw it! Here it is, middle of summer,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:16.35,0:07:19.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,yet there was a person near the\Nhouse, all covered in cloth...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:19.81,0:07:22.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Stop it!\N- No, hold on a minute...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:28.24,0:07:31.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like I may not have to\Ngive up on my fee just yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:32.37,0:07:34.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My instincts are usually right\Nwhere money's involved.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:42.92,0:07:44.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:44.38,0:07:46.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to kill the vampire!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:55.43,0:08:00.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So... your girlfriend was the vampire's...?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:01.40,0:08:03.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah... it's first victim.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:11.70,0:08:12.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryoko?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:18.91,0:08:19.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryo... Ryoko?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:22.88,0:08:23.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw it!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:24.50,0:08:29.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw that creature, that thing\Nin white, go into that house!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:29.68,0:08:32.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Based on that, you think the\Nvampire's in that house?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:33.01,0:08:36.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's got to be! That thing's the vampire!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:36.64,0:08:39.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The thing that ran past me that\Nnight! It was the killer!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:41.06,0:08:44.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it stays at large, there\Nwill be more victims.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:44.61,0:08:48.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't let anyone else\Nsuffer like I have!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:48.74,0:08:51.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miyahito... But by yourself—
Dialogue: 99,0:08:51.41,0:08:53.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To keep that from happening,\NI've got to kill it!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:02.62,0:09:04.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vampiric killings...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:04.71,0:09:08.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One thing common to all the victims\Nwas that they were female... hmm...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:08.92,0:09:10.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A grade schooler, a junior high student,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:10.67,0:09:13.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a college student, a businesswoman,\Nand a housewife... Five in all...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:43.25,0:09:47.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fog, inhuman strength,\Nglowing eyes, fangs... hmm...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:48.42,0:09:51.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just like the vampires of\Nlegend, it would seem.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:54.30,0:09:56.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But perhaps a bit too\Nfaithful to the legend.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:00.35,0:10:02.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think perhaps...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:04.81,0:10:07.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...you shouldn't get any\Nfurther involved in this.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:20.99,0:10:23.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Hold on!\N- Should I get this one?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:24.96,0:10:26.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is mine, for sure!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:26.29,0:10:26.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is mine, for sure!\NWhat was that?\NIt didn't seem like a little girl.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:26.83,0:10:28.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's so cute!\NWhat was that?\NIt didn't seem like a little girl
Dialogue: 99,0:10:28.34,0:10:31.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that?\NIt didn't seem like a little girl.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:33.09,0:10:39.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If Aiko is the vampire, what was her\Nmotive for attacking the women?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:39.97,0:10:43.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For that matter, do vampires\Nreally exist at all?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:28.81,0:11:29.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vampire...!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:43.16,0:11:43.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:44.58,0:11:50.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can it exist... in broad\Ndaylight like this?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:52.98,0:12:54.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vampire!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:55.69,0:12:56.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what you are, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:58.19,0:13:01.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. I am a vampire.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:02.07,0:13:08.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it would seem I'm not quite\Nthe monster you're thinking of.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:09.20,0:13:12.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You prey even on Miyahito...!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:13.58,0:13:14.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:16.59,0:13:20.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's what... he desired.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:25.26,0:13:26.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You lie!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:32.52,0:13:38.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If a human so desires, I can give him\Nimmortality... time everlasting...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:41.53,0:13:42.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:44.16,0:13:47.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The thing that we, as well as you,\Nare chasing after is different.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:49.29,0:13:52.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's only a murderer, capable\Nof bestowing nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:54.08,0:13:59.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just a bloodthirsty, imitation vampire.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:04.55,0:14:11.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes... it is of the Shinma, beings\Nthat are both god and monster.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:12.60,0:14:16.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think you should get involved\Nin this any further, really...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:18.11,0:14:19.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...Spiritualist Himiko.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:20.03,0:14:26.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have no right to say such\Nthings! Vampire! Monster!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:26.28,0:14:28.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People always talk like that..
Dialogue: 99,0:14:30.37,0:14:33.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With clouded eyes and tainted lips.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:36.92,0:14:39.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though the truth\Nis always within them.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:51.72,0:14:54.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miyahito, are you all right?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:58.31,0:15:00.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go to a hospital immediately.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:01.07,0:15:02.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:02.15,0:15:02.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Why?"
Dialogue: 99,0:15:03.28,0:15:05.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you know what just happened...?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:05.74,0:15:08.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel terrific now.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:08.41,0:15:12.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You... You were consumed with grief...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:12.70,0:15:14.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There isn't any now.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:25.01,0:15:26.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:27.97,0:15:32.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The car rolled over, with Aiko\Nand her parents inside.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:32.43,0:15:33.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A rollover?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:34.14,0:15:40.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There was a chance we could save Aiko,\Nif we operated... but not her parents.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:41.15,0:15:44.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, we were out of the AB blood\Nwe needed for the operation,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:46.65,0:15:51.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,as we had already performed a number\Nof emergency operations that day.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:52.45,0:15:56.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the parents realized their\Nown deaths were at hand,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:56.75,0:15:59.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,as they volunteered to donate their\Nown blood to their daughter.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:05.26,0:16:08.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had no choice but to accept.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:15.72,0:16:18.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aiko's parents died while she was\Nstill on the operating table.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:19.94,0:16:23.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does Aiko know about\Nher parents' blood...?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:23.48,0:16:24.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Possibly.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:25.73,0:16:29.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the orphanage, I'm told,\Nshe called herself a vampire.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:37.62,0:16:40.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Surviving by stealing her mother\Nand father's blood...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:41.21,0:16:43.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If she was berating\Nherself like that...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:57.97,0:17:01.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Even though the truth\Nis always within them.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:13.24,0:17:16.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can her parents be here, when\Nthey're supposed to be dead?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:20.12,0:17:21.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ghosts?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:22.00,0:17:22.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh hell...!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:33.13,0:17:34.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The vampire...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:34.93,0:17:37.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The victims were a grade schooler,\Na junior high student,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:37.22,0:17:40.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a college student, a businesswoman,\Nand a housewife...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:40.27,0:17:41.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Women...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:42.39,0:17:46.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Futures closed off... that\Nwould otherwise have existed!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:06.92,0:18:08.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-Aiko...?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:25.06,0:18:26.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:29.40,0:18:31.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you planning on getting\NAiko as well?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:49.34,0:18:51.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the form of the creature\Nthat used Aiko's soul.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:52.21,0:18:54.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,U-Used?!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:54.76,0:18:58.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In return for providing illusionary\Nparents, house, and dreams...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:02.89,0:19:05.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...it drained her of life.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:24.54,0:19:29.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shinma. A fitting name for those\Nwhich are both god and demon.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:29.42,0:19:33.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One of them- this one- took up\Nresidence in her dreams.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:35.13,0:19:38.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's easy for a diseased human\Nsoul to invite the Shinma in.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:39.68,0:19:41.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shin... ma...?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:44.27,0:19:47.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Larva, use its true name,\Nand return it to the Dark!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:53.15,0:19:54.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ra... en?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:58.78,0:20:00.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ra... en?!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:00.78,0:20:03.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More commonly known\Nas Baku, I think.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:03.99,0:20:05.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Shinma who dwells in dreams.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:07.58,0:20:10.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It uses human dreams as\Nthe source of its power.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:16.76,0:20:23.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And with its true name discovered, the\Nmonster loses its power, am I right?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:23.72,0:20:25.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All that remains is to seal it away.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:15.44,0:21:16.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cum rămâne cu Aiko?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:19.74,0:21:20.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A murit.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:21.36,0:21:26.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because when people are taken over by\NShinma, their lives are taken from them.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:27.08,0:21:30.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu ai fi putut s-o salvezi?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:30.50,0:21:33.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Exista un singur mod.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:34.25,0:21:37.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Dar ai intervenit tu, nu-i așa?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:38.30,0:21:42.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Putea să-mi bea sângele \Nși să devină un vampir.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:48.81,0:21:54.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Himiko, I don't know that she would\Nhave preferred continuing to live...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:55.77,0:22:01.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...believing that she was the vampire that\Nkilled her parents... rather than dying, but..
Dialogue: 99,0:22:04.45,0:22:05.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As for Miyahito..
Dialogue: 99,0:22:05.99,0:22:10.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, Himiko, he wanted to escape\Nfrom his grief.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:10.75,0:22:14.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I gave him his own\Nlittle world of fantasy.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:15.50,0:22:20.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So he should be feeling more happiness\Nthan he could wish for in this world.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:22.63,0:22:24.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa stau lucrurile, Himiko.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:25.68,0:22:26.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și acum...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:28.35,0:22:29.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rămas bun!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:32.77,0:22:34.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I... I don't believe...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:36.15,0:22:37.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...in such fantasy worlds!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:00.38,0:23:03.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, they say he's\Nbeen like that for ages.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:03.63,0:23:05.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's famous around here.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:05.30,0:23:07.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,E un adevărat ciudat, nu?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:05.30,0:23:07.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:07.43,0:23:09.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Am auzit de el.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:09.30,0:23:10.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:10.39,0:23:12.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's living in happiness.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:12.27,0:23:15.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Huh?! What?!\N- What do you mean?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:15.64,0:23:19.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nu v-ar plăcea și vouă să fiți \Nfericite pentru totdeauna?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:19.77,0:23:21.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:21.52,0:23:22.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sună dubios!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:23.24,0:23:24.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Așa este!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:27.82,0:23:30.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să mergem sau vom \Nîntârzia la ore.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:30.33,0:23:31.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, să mergem!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:39.50,0:23:43.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I, a spiritualist who didn't believe\Nin the existence of demons...
Dialogue: 99,0:23:45.42,0:23:46.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will hunt down that little devil..
Dialogue: 99,0:23:47.38,0:23:50.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Acea fată-vampir care a dispărut \Nfără a-mi spune cum o cheamă.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:51.89,0:23:57.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Fericirea mea nu e atât de simplă \Nîncât poate fi găsită într-un basm.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.47,0:00:43.94,DezuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur10\bord0\shad0\fscx100\fscy100\pos(720,470)\p1\c&H0000C1&\t(5870,0,1,\c&H080607&)}m -720 -470 l 720 -470 720 610 -720 610
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.47,0:00:43.94,DezuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\c&H020109&\fscx800\fscy800\pos(720,470)\alpha&HFF&\blur2\fsp1\t(0,1600,3,\alpha&H00&)\fnJapan Wave\b0}Miyu
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.47,0:00:43.94,DezuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\c&H020109&\an6\fscx114\fscy114\alpha&HFF&\blur1.5\fsp1\t(0,1600,3,\alpha&H00&)\fnJapan Wave\b0\pos(740,710)}Prințesa-vampir
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.05,0:01:51.97,DezuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur1\bord0\shad0\fscx100\fscy100\pos(340,303)\p1\c&H080707&}m -340 -303 l 1100 -303 1100 777 -340 777
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.05,0:01:51.97,DezuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\pos(340,320)\c&H0000C3&\blur1.5\fnMADE Awelier Black\b0\fscx140\fscy140}Episodul 1
Dialogue: 1,0:01:48.05,0:01:51.97,DezuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\pos(720,480)\c&H0000C3&\blur1.5\an8\fnMADE Awelier Black\b0\fscx200\fscy200}Kyoto-ul supranatural
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.81,0:04:08.69,DezuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\pos(672,500)}Nezawa
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.92,0:04:34.84,DezuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1245,340)\c&H130F0F&\fscx40\fscy40\blur0.8}Nezawa
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.60,0:19:52.52,DezuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,Raen
Dialogue: 99,0:00:01.46,0:00:05.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At one time, gods and\Ndemons were as one.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:06.17,0:00:09.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They were sealed away in the\Nabyss of distant memory.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:09.97,0:00:14.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The hearts of humans who feared\Nthe Dark brought this about.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:14.97,0:00:18.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Shinma" - A combination of "gods" (shin) and "demons" (ma).\NFor the present, let us call\Nthese beings "Shinma. I
Dialogue: 99,0:00:18.31,0:00:23.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now they have awakened from their\Nslumber, and gathered in the Dark.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:23.61,0:00:27.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,On the final night of that gathering,\Nwhen Shinma and Humans met again,
Dialogue: 99,0:00:28.78,0:00:34.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a young girl strayed into their midst.\NThis is her story. Her name is...
Dialogue: 99,0:00:53.30,0:00:54.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- How about tomorrow?\N- Sure.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:54.72,0:00:58.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay, then, the Shijo Station ticket counter\Nat one o'clock. Don't be late.
Dialogue: 99,0:00:58.56,0:01:00.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ai încredere în mine!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:02.35,0:01:06.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. But don't worry. I'll be\Nthere tomorrow, I promise!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:06.32,0:01:06.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah, right...
Dialogue: 99,0:01:09.82,0:01:12.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryoko, are you sure you don't\Nwant me to walk you home?
Dialogue: 99,0:01:12.28,0:01:14.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. It's really close by.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:15.12,0:01:16.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take care, then.
Dialogue: 99,0:01:16.49,0:01:18.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bine. Ne vedem mâine!
Dialogue: 99,0:01:55.32,0:01:59.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Excuse me for a moment.\NPlease take your time.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:00.08,0:02:01.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:22.27,0:02:27.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the fifth one, right, sir?\NNot a drop of blood left in her body
Dialogue: 99,0:02:27.44,0:02:30.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can something so ridiculous happen?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:30.52,0:02:33.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just like a vampire...\NCould that be what it is?
Dialogue: 99,0:02:33.40,0:02:37.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Cut that out. The coroner's\Nlooking into it right now.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:37.45,0:02:39.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't say stupid things like that again.
Dialogue: 99,0:02:44.16,0:02:47.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Scary...\N- How scary.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:19.37,0:03:20.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Man, it's hot.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:35.97,0:03:36.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fine...
Dialogue: 99,0:03:45.35,0:03:51.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A rash of vampiric attacks had set the\Nold capital of Kyoto abuzz with rumor.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:51.36,0:03:56.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I was visiting there on a consultation.
Dialogue: 99,0:03:56.86,0:03:59.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The request came from the\Nparents of a princess
Dialogue: 99,0:03:59.99,0:04:02.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,who had pricked her finger\Non the thorn of a rose.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:08.75,0:04:13.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Spiritualist... a one-word job title that\Ncovers a variety of activities.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:15.05,0:04:19.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But those with truly strong\Nspiritual powers
Dialogue: 99,0:04:19.26,0:04:21.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,have a hard time making\Na living using them.
Dialogue: 99,0:04:32.23,0:04:34.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Heh... garlic.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:31.58,0:05:40.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You said she's been asleep for 60 days now\NHave you taken her to a doctor?
Dialogue: 99,0:05:41.09,0:05:45.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The doctors gave up on her in the\Nfirst week. Said she was hopeless.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:46.10,0:05:49.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We also had an eminent high\Npriest take a look at her.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:49.68,0:05:54.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But... at that time...
Dialogue: 99,0:05:54.81,0:05:57.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,..all he told us was that something\Nhad possessed her.
Dialogue: 99,0:05:57.86,0:05:59.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:03.32,0:06:04.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Possession.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:05.49,0:06:09.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This phenomenon, which can usually be\Nexplained as some form of psychosis,
Dialogue: 99,0:06:09.58,0:06:14.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,is still an object of terror, smoldering\Nin the depths of the Japanese soul.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:14.87,0:06:19.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But in fact, one rarely if ever comes\Nacross a true case of possession.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:21.84,0:06:22.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A fox spirit?
Dialogue: 99,0:06:23.38,0:06:29.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It seems she truly is possessed.\NAllow me to deal with this in my own way.
Dialogue: 99,0:06:38.06,0:06:39.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This'll be informal, but..
Dialogue: 99,0:06:59.92,0:07:01.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:03.38,0:07:05.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll for ego my fee, naturally.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:06.47,0:07:11.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Um... There are rumors going around\Nabout a vampire appearing in town...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:11.51,0:07:12.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Stop talking such nonsense!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:12.89,0:07:16.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw it! Here it is, middle of summer,
Dialogue: 99,0:07:16.35,0:07:19.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,yet there was a person near the\Nhouse, all covered in cloth...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:19.81,0:07:22.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Stop it!\N- No, hold on a minute...
Dialogue: 99,0:07:28.24,0:07:31.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It looks like I may not have to\Ngive up on my fee just yet.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:32.37,0:07:34.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My instincts are usually right\Nwhere money's involved.
Dialogue: 99,0:07:42.92,0:07:44.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 99,0:07:44.38,0:07:46.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going to kill the vampire!
Dialogue: 99,0:07:55.43,0:08:00.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So... your girlfriend was the vampire's...?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:01.40,0:08:03.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yeah... it's first victim.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:11.70,0:08:12.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryoko?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:18.91,0:08:19.96,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryo... Ryoko?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:22.88,0:08:23.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw it!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:24.50,0:08:29.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I saw that creature, that thing\Nin white, go into that house!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:29.68,0:08:32.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Based on that, you think the\Nvampire's in that house?
Dialogue: 99,0:08:33.01,0:08:36.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's got to be! That thing's the vampire!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:36.64,0:08:39.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The thing that ran past me that\Nnight! It was the killer!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:41.06,0:08:44.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If it stays at large, there\Nwill be more victims.
Dialogue: 99,0:08:44.61,0:08:48.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't let anyone else\Nsuffer like I have!
Dialogue: 99,0:08:48.74,0:08:51.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miyahito... But by yourself—
Dialogue: 99,0:08:51.41,0:08:53.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To keep that from happening,\NI've got to kill it!
Dialogue: 99,0:09:02.62,0:09:04.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vampiric killings...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:04.71,0:09:08.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One thing common to all the victims\Nwas that they were female... hmm...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:08.92,0:09:10.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A grade schooler, a junior high student,
Dialogue: 99,0:09:10.67,0:09:13.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a college student, a businesswoman,\Nand a housewife... Five in all...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:43.25,0:09:47.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fog, inhuman strength,\Nglowing eyes, fangs... hmm...
Dialogue: 99,0:09:48.42,0:09:51.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Just like the vampires of\Nlegend, it would seem.
Dialogue: 99,0:09:54.30,0:09:56.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But perhaps a bit too\Nfaithful to the legend.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:00.35,0:10:02.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I think perhaps...
Dialogue: 99,0:10:04.81,0:10:07.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...you shouldn't get any\Nfurther involved in this.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:20.99,0:10:23.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Hold on!\N- Should I get this one?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:24.96,0:10:26.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is mine, for sure!
Dialogue: 99,0:10:26.29,0:10:26.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is mine, for sure!\NWhat was that?\NIt didn't seem like a little girl.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:26.83,0:10:28.34,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's so cute!\NWhat was that?\NIt didn't seem like a little girl
Dialogue: 99,0:10:28.34,0:10:31.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What was that?\NIt didn't seem like a little girl.
Dialogue: 99,0:10:33.09,0:10:39.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If Aiko is the vampire, what was her\Nmotive for attacking the women?
Dialogue: 99,0:10:39.97,0:10:43.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For that matter, do vampires\Nreally exist at all?
Dialogue: 99,0:11:28.81,0:11:29.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vampire...!
Dialogue: 99,0:11:43.16,0:11:43.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How...
Dialogue: 99,0:11:44.58,0:11:50.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can it exist... in broad\Ndaylight like this?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:52.98,0:12:54.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vampire!
Dialogue: 99,0:12:55.69,0:12:56.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's what you are, isn't it?
Dialogue: 99,0:12:58.19,0:13:01.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. I am a vampire.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:02.07,0:13:08.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But it would seem I'm not quite\Nthe monster you're thinking of.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:09.20,0:13:12.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You prey even on Miyahito...!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:13.58,0:13:14.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:16.59,0:13:20.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's what... he desired.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:25.26,0:13:26.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You lie!
Dialogue: 99,0:13:32.52,0:13:38.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If a human so desires, I can give him\Nimmortality... time everlasting...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:41.53,0:13:42.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 99,0:13:44.16,0:13:47.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The thing that we, as well as you,\Nare chasing after is different.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:49.29,0:13:52.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's only a murderer, capable\Nof bestowing nothing.
Dialogue: 99,0:13:54.08,0:13:59.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's just a bloodthirsty, imitation vampire.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:04.55,0:14:11.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes... it is of the Shinma, beings\Nthat are both god and monster.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:12.60,0:14:16.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't think you should get involved\Nin this any further, really...
Dialogue: 99,0:14:18.11,0:14:19.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...Spiritualist Himiko.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:20.03,0:14:26.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You have no right to say such\Nthings! Vampire! Monster!
Dialogue: 99,0:14:26.28,0:14:28.16,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,People always talk like that..
Dialogue: 99,0:14:30.37,0:14:33.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,With clouded eyes and tainted lips.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:36.92,0:14:39.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Even though the truth\Nis always within them.
Dialogue: 99,0:14:51.72,0:14:54.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Miyahito, are you all right?
Dialogue: 99,0:14:58.31,0:15:00.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let's go to a hospital immediately.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:01.07,0:15:02.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:02.15,0:15:02.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Why?"
Dialogue: 99,0:15:03.28,0:15:05.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't you know what just happened...?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:05.74,0:15:08.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I feel terrific now.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:08.41,0:15:12.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You... You were consumed with grief...
Dialogue: 99,0:15:12.70,0:15:14.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There isn't any now.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:25.01,0:15:26.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:27.97,0:15:32.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The car rolled over, with Aiko\Nand her parents inside.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:32.43,0:15:33.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A rollover?
Dialogue: 99,0:15:34.14,0:15:40.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There was a chance we could save Aiko,\Nif we operated... but not her parents.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:41.15,0:15:44.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,However, we were out of the AB blood\Nwe needed for the operation,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:46.65,0:15:51.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,as we had already performed a number\Nof emergency operations that day.
Dialogue: 99,0:15:52.45,0:15:56.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Perhaps the parents realized their\Nown deaths were at hand,
Dialogue: 99,0:15:56.75,0:15:59.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,as they volunteered to donate their\Nown blood to their daughter.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:05.26,0:16:08.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I had no choice but to accept.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:15.72,0:16:18.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Aiko's parents died while she was\Nstill on the operating table.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:19.94,0:16:23.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Does Aiko know about\Nher parents' blood...?
Dialogue: 99,0:16:23.48,0:16:24.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Possibly.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:25.73,0:16:29.53,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,At the orphanage, I'm told,\Nshe called herself a vampire.
Dialogue: 99,0:16:37.62,0:16:40.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Surviving by stealing her mother\Nand father's blood...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:41.21,0:16:43.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If she was berating\Nherself like that...
Dialogue: 99,0:16:57.97,0:17:01.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,"Even though the truth\Nis always within them.
Dialogue: 99,0:17:13.24,0:17:16.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How can her parents be here, when\Nthey're supposed to be dead?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:20.12,0:17:21.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ghosts?
Dialogue: 99,0:17:22.00,0:17:22.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh hell...!
Dialogue: 99,0:17:33.13,0:17:34.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The vampire...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:34.93,0:17:37.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The victims were a grade schooler,\Na junior high student,
Dialogue: 99,0:17:37.22,0:17:40.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,a college student, a businesswoman,\Nand a housewife...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:40.27,0:17:41.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Women...
Dialogue: 99,0:17:42.39,0:17:46.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Futures closed off... that\Nwould otherwise have existed!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:06.92,0:18:08.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,A-Aiko...?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:25.06,0:18:26.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:29.40,0:18:31.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are you planning on getting\NAiko as well?
Dialogue: 99,0:18:49.34,0:18:51.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the form of the creature\Nthat used Aiko's soul.
Dialogue: 99,0:18:52.21,0:18:54.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,U-Used?!
Dialogue: 99,0:18:54.76,0:18:58.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,In return for providing illusionary\Nparents, house, and dreams...
Dialogue: 99,0:19:02.89,0:19:05.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...it drained her of life.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:24.54,0:19:29.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shinma. A fitting name for those\Nwhich are both god and demon.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:29.42,0:19:33.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,One of them- this one- took up\Nresidence in her dreams.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:35.13,0:19:38.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's easy for a diseased human\Nsoul to invite the Shinma in.
Dialogue: 99,0:19:39.68,0:19:41.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Shin... ma...?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:44.27,0:19:47.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Larva, use its true name,\Nand return it to the Dark!
Dialogue: 99,0:19:53.15,0:19:54.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ra... en?
Dialogue: 99,0:19:58.78,0:20:00.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ra... en?!
Dialogue: 99,0:20:00.78,0:20:03.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,More commonly known\Nas Baku, I think.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:03.99,0:20:05.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The Shinma who dwells in dreams.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:07.58,0:20:10.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It uses human dreams as\Nthe source of its power.
Dialogue: 99,0:20:16.76,0:20:23.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And with its true name discovered, the\Nmonster loses its power, am I right?
Dialogue: 99,0:20:23.72,0:20:25.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All that remains is to seal it away.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:15.44,0:21:16.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about Aiko?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:19.74,0:21:20.86,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's dead.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:21.36,0:21:26.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because when people are taken over by\NShinma, their lives are taken from them.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:27.08,0:21:30.04,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Couldn't you have saved her?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:30.50,0:21:33.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There was only one way.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:34.25,0:21:37.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But you interfered, didn't you?
Dialogue: 99,0:21:38.30,0:21:42.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She could have taken my blood\Nand become a vampire.
Dialogue: 99,0:21:48.81,0:21:54.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Himiko, I don't know that she would\Nhave preferred continuing to live...
Dialogue: 99,0:21:55.77,0:22:01.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...believing that she was the vampire that\Nkilled her parents... rather than dying, but..
Dialogue: 99,0:22:04.45,0:22:05.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,As for Miyahito..
Dialogue: 99,0:22:05.99,0:22:10.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, Himiko, he wanted to escape\Nfrom his grief.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:10.75,0:22:14.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So I gave him his own\Nlittle world of fantasy.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:15.50,0:22:20.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So he should be feeling more happiness\Nthan he could wish for in this world.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:22.63,0:22:24.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Acesta e adevărul, Himiko.
Dialogue: 99,0:22:25.68,0:22:26.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Și acum...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:28.35,0:22:29.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Rămas bun!
Dialogue: 99,0:22:32.77,0:22:34.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I... I don't believe...
Dialogue: 99,0:22:36.15,0:22:37.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...in such fantasy worlds!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:00.38,0:23:03.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey, they say he's\Nbeen like that for ages.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:03.63,0:23:05.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's famous around here.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:05.30,0:23:07.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- He's weird, huh?\N- Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:07.43,0:23:09.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I know about him.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:09.30,0:23:10.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:10.39,0:23:12.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's living in happiness.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:12.27,0:23:15.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Huh?! What?!\N- What do you mean?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:15.64,0:23:19.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you like to be able\Nto be happy forever?
Dialogue: 99,0:23:19.77,0:23:21.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ce?!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:21.48,0:23:24.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- That's weird!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:21.48,0:23:24.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- It sure is!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:27.82,0:23:30.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Să mergem sau vom \Nîntârzia la ore.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:30.33,0:23:31.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Da, să mergem!
Dialogue: 99,0:23:39.50,0:23:43.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I, a spiritualist who didn't believe\Nin the existence of demons...
Dialogue: 99,0:23:45.42,0:23:46.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I will hunt down that little devil..
Dialogue: 99,0:23:47.38,0:23:50.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That vampire girl who disappeared\Nwithout even telling me her name.
Dialogue: 99,0:23:51.89,0:23:57.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My happiness isn't so trivial that\Nit can be found in a fantasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.52,0:19:53.15,DezuyaSigns,,0,0,0,,
